OL,3,GNEWSAArchbishop to visit Herefordshire
OL,4,Aand Shropshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Archbishop of Canterbury is
OL,7,Fvisiting Herefordshire and Shropshire
OL,8,Fnext month as part of anniversary
OL,9,Fcelebrations and also to hear about
OL,10,Fmission and outreach in rural areas.
OL,12,FThe Most Revd Dame Sarah Mullally is
OL,13,Fvisiting the Diocese of Hereford during
OL,14,Fits 1,350th anniversary year, following
OL,15,Fan invite from the Bishop of Hereford,
OL,16,FThe Rt Revd Richard Jackson.
OL,18,FShe will be attending services at
OL,19,FHereford Cathedral and in Ludlow on 10
OL,20,FOctober, then visit the Much Marcle Big
OL,21,FApple Festival on 11 October.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
