OL,3,GNEWSAArchbishop to visit Herefordshire
OL,4,Aand Shropshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of the visit, the archbishop
OL,7,Fsaid: "I look forward to praying and
OL,8,Fworshipping with you all and seeing the
OL,9,Fways that you make Jesus known in your
OL,10,Fcommunities across the diocese."
